@pedro-psb I am not sure yet if we really need pyparsing or if we can solve it by using a simple split() and maybe regexp.

If we need pyparsing, then we must avoid vendoring it and make this feature optional, as an extra dependency to install, not added by default.

```python
THING = "@get VAR @int"
